# Andrej Karpathy's 4 Engineering Principles for SeeOut Platform

1. [Understand & Inspect Data Thoroughly]
   - Always inspect the raw source data (Google Docs, e하늘 API, certificates) directly before coding.
   - Do not guess schema structures or make assumptions about data anomalies.

2. [Start with a Simple, Dumb Baseline First]
   - Build a minimal end-to-end working baseline first.
   - Avoid premature abstraction, unnecessary dependencies, and over-engineering.

3. [Verify Obsessively & Overfit a Single Batch]
   - Write deterministic unit tests for single samples first.
   - Ensure 100% assertions pass on concrete cases before processing full batches.

4. [Iterate and Generalize Progressively]
   - Change one variable or feature at a time.
   - Validate regression after every iteration.
